# ── Secrets / credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit these. They're OAuth client secrets and cached user tokens.
SteamScraper/credentials.json
SteamScraper/credentials.json.old
SteamScraper/credentials.json.old2
SteamScraper/token.json
SteamScraper/tokenold.json

# ── User config (per-machine paths, Sheet IDs) ────────────────────────
# Track a neonwhite_config.example.json template instead (todo item).
SteamScraper/neonwhite_config.json

# ── Third-party redistributables ──────────────────────────────────────
# Valve's Steam runtime DLL — users should supply their own from their
# Neon White install via neonwhite_config.json's dll_path.
SteamScraper/steam_api64.dll

# ── Claude Code local-only settings ───────────────────────────────────
# Permission allowlists granted on this machine. A shared .claude/settings.json
# (without `.local`) IS meant to be tracked if you ever add one.
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# ── PyInstaller build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────
SteamScraper/build/
SteamScraper/dist/
*.manifest
NeonWhiteLeaderboardTool.exe
SteamScraper/NeonWhiteLeaderboardTool.exe

# ── Compiled C side-products (keep shuffle.dll itself) ────────────────
# shuffle.dll is committed so the app runs out-of-box without a C compiler.
# These are intermediate MSVC linker outputs from compile_shuffle.py.
SteamScraper/shuffle.exp
SteamScraper/shuffle.lib
SteamScraper/shuffle.obj

# ── CSV outputs (sample/test data, regenerable) ───────────────────────
SteamScraper/*.csv

# ── Obsidian per-user state ───────────────────────────────────────────
# workspace.json churns every time you change panes — would dominate diffs.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache

# ── OS / editor cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
